    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27475" root="طيف" body-key="T">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَافَ الخَيَالُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَطِيفُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْفٌ</span> (S,
O, Msb, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطَافٌ</span>; (S, O, K;) thus says
As: (TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَافَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَطُوفُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوْفٌ</span>;
(O, K;) thus says El-Mufaddal: (O, TA:)
<i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خيال</span> [i. e. <i>apparition,</i> or <i>phantom,</i>] <i>came</i>
(S, O, Msb, K) <i>in sleep.</i> (S, O, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طاف</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ الخَيَالُ</span> <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خيال</span> <i>came to him,</i> or <i>visited him,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَمَّ بِهِ</span>,) <i>in sleep.</i> (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طوف</span>,)

